# Files in the repo that should NOT be published to sporteurotour.com.
# wrangler.jsonc sets "directory": "./", so by default EVERYTHING in the repo root
# gets served as a public static asset. That included the whole .git folder and all
# the internal notes. Verified publicly reachable on Aug 14, 2026 before this file:
#   sporteurotour.com/.git/config, /.git/HEAD, /.git/index
#   sporteurotour.com/PROJECT-NOTES.txt
#   sporteurotour.com/WEBSITE-PLAYBOOK.txt
#   sporteurotour.com/cloudcannon.config.yml
#   sporteurotour.com/wrangler.jsonc
#
# These files STAY in the GitHub repo. They just stop being served to the public.
# Do NOT add robots.txt, sitemap.xml, images/, docs/ or any .html page here.

.git
.wrangler

PROJECT-NOTES.txt
WEBSITE-PLAYBOOK.txt
DNS-SNAPSHOT-2026-07-17.txt

cloudcannon.config.yml
wrangler.jsonc

hero-options.html
